# {{product.name}} — the team, and who may write what

One rule underneath everything else: **nothing reaches the default branch of any {{product.name}} repository
without the owner's review and verification.** The rest of this page says what that means for each person,
for each path, and for the Claude Code sessions that do most of the typing.

This page is referenced from [`CLAUDE.md`](../CLAUDE.md) §Who is who and is the record of the roles. Where
this page and a Claude Code session's own judgment disagree, this page wins; where this page and `CLAUDE.md`
disagree, `CLAUDE.md` wins and this page is behind. The people named here are the ones in `hub.json`; when
someone joins or leaves, change `hub.json` first and re-render this page (`python tools/hub_init.py --from-hub`).

